<title>HUNGARY: Hungary gross foreign debt $27.62 bln in July.</title>
<headline>Hungary gross foreign debt $27.62 bln in July.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's gross foreign debt stood at $27.62 billion in July, rising slightly from $27.54 billion in June, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Monday.  </p>
<p>    FIGURES IN $ MILLION	 July 96	   June 96</p>
<p> Gross foreign debt	     27,622.9	  27,535.5</p>
<p>International reserves and</p>
<p> other foreign assets	   13,268.3	  13,256.5</p>
<p> Net foreign debt		 14,354.5	  14,278.9</p>
<p>Net foreign debt of the</p>
<p> government and NBH	     10,075.9	   9,510.9</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
